====Trivia====
The bomb dropped on Hiroshima, was the [[uranium]]-fired [[Little Boy]]. Three days later, [[Nagasaki]] was [[nuke]]d. These remain, as of 2024, the only time [[nuclear bomb]]s have actually been fired off in anger.

